mhvtl-control (0.3.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  The options file moved from /etc/mhvtl/mhvtl-control.env to
  /etc/mhvtl-control/mhvtl-control.env, so that mhVTL's /etc/mhvtl holds only
  mhVTL's own configuration. If you edited the old file, the upgrade moves it
  to the new path, token included, and keeps the new packaged default next to
  it as mhvtl-control.env.dpkg-new. If you did not, the old file is removed
  and the new default is installed.

 -- Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte@gmail.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0300
